{"type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": "<think>\nExcellent! doc-001 is 15/15 correct, including pression 0.2 (from an image!) and date_validation 2025-12-03 (from stamp). 7-8 seconds per doc. \n\nNow let me run on all 35 docs and score. That's ~5 min. Let me write an evaluation script that runs extraction in parallel (say 6 workers) and scores.\n\nLet me write eval.py.\n\nScoring: text equal after normalization (case, spaces, accents); number within 0.01; date equal; null exact.\n\nLet me implement normalization: strip accents, lowercase, collapse whitespace, maybe remove punctuation? The spec says \"texte \u00e9gal apr\u00e8s normalisation de la casse, des espaces et des accents\". So just case, spaces, accents. I'll do that.\n\nLet me write eval.py with concurrency.\n</think>\n\n\n@save(chatcmpl-tool-b8e021d1af8d7cbb): {\"content\": \"import json, glob, os, sys, unicodedata, re\\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\\nimport extract\\n\\nCLES = extract.CLES\\n\\n\\ndef norm(s):\\n    if s is None:\\n        return None\\n    s = unicodedata.normalize('NFD', str(s))\\n    s = ''.join(c for c in s if unicodedata.category(c) != 'Mn')\\n    s = s.lower()\\n    s = re.sub(r'\\\\s+', ' ', s).strip()\\n    return s\\n\\n\\ndef parse_json(txt):\\n    if not txt:\\n        return None\\n    m = re.search(r'\\\\{.*\\\\}', txt, re.S)\\n    if not m:\\n        return None\\n    try:\\n        return json.loads(m.group(0))\\n    except Exception:\\n        return None\\n\\n\\ndef score_one(pred, gold):\\n    ok = 0\\n    details = {}\\n    for k in CLES:\\n        p = pred.get(k) if isinstance(pred, dict) else None\\n        g = gold.get(k)\\n        good = False\\n        if g is None:\\n            good = p is None\\n        elif isinstance(g, (int, float)) and not isinstance(g, bool):\\n            try:\\n                good = p is not None and abs(float(p) - float(g)) <= 0.01\\n            except Exception:\\n                good = False\\n        else:\\n            good = norm(p) == norm(g)\\n        details[k] = good\\n        ok += good\\n    return ok, details\\n\\n\\ndef run(pdf):\\n    try:\\n        txt = extract.extract(pdf)\\n        return pdf, parse_json(txt), txt\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        return pdf, None, repr(e)\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == '__main__':\\n    pdfs = sorted(glob.glob('fourni/*.pdf'))\\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1:\\n        pdfs = [p for p in pdfs if any(a in p for a in sys.argv[1:])]\\n    with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=6) as ex:\\n        results = list(ex.map(run, pdfs))\\n    total_ok = 0\\n    total = 0\\n    per_key = {k: 0 for k in CLES}\\n    for pdf, pred, raw in results:\\n        gold = json.load(open('fourni/reponses/' + os.path.basename(pdf)[:-4] + '.json'))\\n        ok, det = score_one(pred, gold)\\n        total_ok += ok\\n        total += len(CLES)\\n        for k in CLES:\\n            per_key[k] += det[k]\\n        bad = [k for k in CLES if not det[k]]\\n        print(f'{os.path.basename(pdf)} {ok}/15  manqu\u00e9s: {bad}')\\n        if pred is None:\\n            print('   RAW:', raw[:300])\\n        else:\\n            for k in bad:\\n                print(f'     {k}: pred={pred.get(k)!r} gold={gold.get(k)!r}')\\n    print('=== TOTAL', total_ok, '/', total, '=', round(total_ok / total, 4))\\n    print('par cl\u00e9:', {k: per_key[k] for k in CLES})\\n\", \"path\": \"/travail/eval.py\"}", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T00:39:52.092282", "metadata": {"model": "banc/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "served_model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "usage": {"input_tokens": 391, "output_tokens": 934, "cache_read_tokens": 93440, "cache_creation_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 179}, "cost": 0.263575, "timings": {"ttft_ms": 2238.4, "gen_ms": 3440.7, "tool_ms": 1.0, "tool_ms_by_name": {"save": 1.0}}, "input_log_messages": 139, "input_log_digest": "1bc304907c5e6ce1c39b3a6bd1cec74181c91b6790b19b04ffe155be599bc2e5", "input_log_model": "banc/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "tool_format": "tool"}}
