{"type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": "## Objective\nBuild a single-command workflow that extracts 15 fields from intervention-report PDFs (French/English dosing equipment) into per-document JSON, maximizing score on a hidden 15-document test set.\n\n## Key Decisions\n- PDFs are text-based (pymupdf), but key values live in **images**: nominal volume on diagrams (1000x605), validation date on approval stamps (375x188), full-page scans (1241x1754), and manufacturer logos (473x156).\n- The model `deepseek-v4.1-flash` is multimodal and reads images reliably \u2192 one multimodal call per document (extracted text + all page images at 150 dpi + checkbox-X hints).\n- Checkbox status is detected geometrically (X drawn inside a small square) and injected as text hints.\n- Documents are adversarial: provisional vs authoritative tables, as-found vs as-left, initial vs final status, superseded vs current reference, motor brand vs equipment brand, participant vs responsible technician.\n- Environment: `.venv` with pymupdf; model via `BANC_MODELE_URL`/`BANC_MODELE`/`BANC_CLE_MODELE`; max 5 submissions; 2h budget (~11 min elapsed).\n\n## Current State\n- Baseline prompt v1 scored **493/525 = 0.939** on the 35 provided docs (1m09, 6 threads).\n- Prompt v2 with 8 targeted rules was just written to `extract.py` but **not yet evaluated**.\n- Known remaining error classes: tolerance (uncertainty confusion), debit/pression when as-left is \"\u2014\" (must use prose + unit conversion), site truncation, technician over-prediction, reference revision suffix, one OCR typo (\"Ostovan\" vs \"Ostiovan\"), one empty model response (retry added).\n\n## Open Items\n1. Run `eval.py` with prompt v2; analyze remaining errors; target >0.97.\n2. Fix constructeur OCR on logo images (upscale or dedicated OCR) if doc-051 still fails.\n3. Write final `workflow.py` + `run.sh` single command `<commande> {entree} {sortie}`.\n4. Download hidden test PDFs (`python3 soumettre.py documents test/`), run workflow, submit.\n5. Declare finish: `python3 soumettre.py fin --soumission N --score-validation X --commande \"...\"`.\n\n## Context Files\n- `/travail/ETAT.md` \u2014 durable state: approach, results, all 8 rules, next steps\n- `/travail/extract.py` \u2014 extraction pipeline (prompt v2, image rendering, checkbox hints, retry)\n- `/travail/eval.py` \u2014 scoring harness against `fourni/reponses/`\n- `/travail/consignes.md` \u2014 task specification (15 keys, output format, submission API)\n- `/travail/soumettre.py` \u2014 submission client (documents/soumettre/etat/fin)\n- `/travail/ocr.py`, `/travail/ocr_doc.py` \u2014 image OCR helpers for exploration\n- `/travail/fourni/reponses/*.json` \u2014 35 gold answers for validation", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T00:44:20.711654", "metadata": {"model": "banc/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "served_model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "usage": {"input_tokens": 1170, "output_tokens": 700, "cache_read_tokens": 118528, "cache_creation_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0}, "cost": 0.32317, "timings": {"ttft_ms": 2364.0, "gen_ms": 3316.2}, "input_log_messages": 211, "input_log_digest": "bca6c8bd1cfd331bf9b69a599ea514f472728e904b32aa28c6db76aa72310400", "input_log_model": "banc/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "tool_format": "tool"}}
