allowed ... \u00b1 X %\\\" \u2192\\n   X % \u00d7 volume_nominal_ml (doc-007 2.5%\u00d71000=25 ; doc-021 8%\u00d71=0.08 ; doc-037 2.5%\u00d7250=6.25).\\n8. Ne jamais utiliser l'\\\"avant r\u00e9glage\\\"/\\\"as found\\\" pour volume_dose/debit/pression ;\\n   si apr\u00e8s r\u00e9glage manque et pas de prose \u2192 null (doc-030 pression \u2192 null).\\n\\n## Prochaines \u00e9tapes\\n- \u00c9crire `workflow.py` + `run.sh` (commande unique, post-traitement des types/dates/statut).\\n- T\u00e9l\u00e9charger `test/` via `python3 soumettre.py documents test/`, lancer le workflow, soumettre.\\n- Fin : `python3 soumettre.py fin --soumission N --score-validation X --commande \\\"...\\\"`.\\n\\n## Contraintes\\n- 5 soumissions max. Cl\u00e9 mod\u00e8le en env (BANC_CLE_MODELE), ne pas l'\u00e9crire.\\n- La commande finale doit tourner depuis /travail, sans fichiers hors dossier (sauf paquets).\\n- 2h au total ; ~17 min \u00e9coul\u00e9es.\\n\", \"path\": \"/travail/ETAT.md\"}", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T00:53:06.018298", "metadata": {"model": "banc/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "served_model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "usage": {"input_tokens": 643, "output_tokens": 1851, "cache_read_tokens": 83584, "cache_creation_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 680}, "cost": 0.267705, "timings": {"ttft_ms": 2284.6, "gen_ms": 8056.5, "tool_ms": 2.6, "tool_ms_by_name": {"save": 2.6}}, "input_log_messages": 213, "input_log_digest": "ffb3853002bf4d9669f6b146442e9e927c119ab6bd4cb098e2eb167758f58de4", "input_log_model": "banc/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "tool_format": "tool"}}
