I. BACKGROUND
Background and equipment
Guide lubrication was topped up as per the manual. Suction filters were removed, rinsed and refitted. The visit concerns the dosing
equipment of line 1. It is driven by a Vergen motor, type T91-4P. Checks were carried out with calibrated instruments; certificates
are available to the customer. The night shift was informed of the adjustments made.
Course of the visit
The work area was cordoned off for the whole duration of the visit. The previous preventive visit only involved cleaning the fluid
