settled at 5.07 mL on average, against 5.33 mL on arrival. Production data from recent weeks was reviewed with the customer.
Replacements
Dried product residue on the frame was cleaned off. No replacement was needed; part NE-119-C (check valve) was nevertheless
ordered as a precaution. Part NE-761-A (dosing nozzle) was inspected and found in good condition. Operators reported short
stoppages at shift start, with no alarm message.
